From 844d5d50270b467fa74e08272d91f9eff1fe49d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Feb 2026 10:00:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 443/572] fix(stm32mp2): skip minor version check if it is 0

If ST_CTX_VER_MINOR is 0, there is no point checking that the saved
minor version of context is inferior to that, as it is an unsigned
variable. Put the check under #if ST_CTX_VER_MINOR > 0.
This was found by Coverity (no_effect unsigned_compare_macros).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git d7c8d9ace238e040df88d9596d7ed10b4fa86f00 fix(stm32mp2): skip minor version check if it is 0]
Change-Id: Ic55e3b02d4d99653461e5a53213da3459e20b03e
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/541286
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_context.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_context.c b/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_context.c
index 23db225c8f..5fb7f88e97 100644
--- a/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_context.c
+++ b/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_context.c
@@ -113,7 +113,9 @@ bool stm32_pm_context_is_valid(void)
 	} else {
 #if STM32MP_CONTEXT_VERSION
 		if ((ST_CTX_VER_GET_MAJOR(backup_data->version) != ST_CTX_VER_MAJOR) ||
+#if ST_CTX_VER_MINOR > 0
 		    (ST_CTX_VER_GET_MINOR(backup_data->version) < ST_CTX_VER_MINOR) ||
+#endif
 		    (backup_data->size < sizeof(*backup_data))) {
 			ret = false;
 		} else {
-- 
